msgid ""
msgstr "本示例演示了向量加法这一基础计算模式。它展示了如何在OpenCL中编写一个简单的内核，该内核接收两个输入向量，将其逐元素相加，并将结果存储到第三个向量中。该示例涵盖了主机端代码编写、内核编译、缓冲区创建以及内核执行等关键步骤，为理解OpenCL编程模型提供了清晰的起点。"

msgid "向量相加 （Vector Addition）"
msgstr "Vector Addition"

msgid "在本节中，我们将使用 Triton 编写一个简单的向量相加的程序。 在此过程中，你会学习到："
msgstr "In this section, we will use Triton to write a simple vector addition program. Along the way, you will learn:"

msgid "Triton 的基本编程模式。"
msgstr "Basic programming model of Triton."

msgid "用于定义Triton内核的`triton.jit`装饰器（decorator）。"
msgstr "The `triton.jit` decorator used to define Triton kernels."

msgid "计算内核:"
msgstr "Compute kernel:"

msgid "创建一个辅助函数用于："
msgstr "Create a helper function to:"

msgid "生成 z 张量；"
msgstr "Generate the z tensor."

msgid "用适当的 grid/block sizes 将上述内核加入队列。"
msgstr "Enqueue the above kernel with appropriate grid/block sizes."

msgid "使用上述函数计算两个 `torch.tensor` 对象的 element-wise sum，并测试其正确性："
msgstr "Use the above function to compute the element-wise sum of two `torch.tensor` objects and test its correctness."

msgid "Out:"
msgstr "Out:"

msgid "\"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0\" 表示Triton和PyTorch的输出结果一致。"
msgstr "\"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0\" indicates that the output results of Triton and PyTorch are identical."
